(69386: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %2F%2F%21%20The%20Rocq%20emitter%3A%20writes%20a%20checked%20program%20as%20Rocq%20with%20its%20translation%20contract.%0A%2F%2F%21%0A%2F%2F%21%20Naturals%20become%20binary%20%60N%60%20and%20integers%20%60Z%60%2C%20so%20programs%20run%20at%20their%0A%2F%2F%21%20source%20sizes%20%28unary%20%60nat%60%20cannot%20hold%2020%21%29.%20Structural%20recursion%20over%20data%0A%2F%2F%21%20is%20a%20%60Fixpoint%60%3B%20recursion%20that%20decreases%20a%20natural%20is%20a%20%60Function%60%20with%0A%2F%2F%21%20the%20measure%20%60N.to_nat%60%2C%20whose%20obligations%20%60lia%60%20discharges%20and%20whose%0A%2F%2F%21%20equation%20lemma%20the%20reconstructed%20proofs%20rewrite%20with.%20A%20JavaScript%20Number%0A%2F%2F%21%20is%20a%20primitive%20%60float%60%2C%20which%20the%20kernel%20computes%20with%2C%20so%20assertions%20about%0A%2F%2F%21%20Numbers%20are%20still%20theorems%20closed%20by%20computation.%0A%2F%2F%21%0A%2F%2F%21%20Mirrors%20%60js%2Fsrc%2Ftranslation%2Femit-rocq.js%60.%0A%0Ause%20std%3A%3Acollections%3A%3A%7BHashMap%2C%20HashSet%7D%3B%0Ause%20std%3A%3Afmt%3A%3AWrite%20as%20_%3B%0Ause%20std%3A%3Arc%3A%3ARc%3B%0A%0Ause%20super%3A%3ALanguage%3B%0Ause%20super%3A%3Adiagnostics%3A%3A%7BErrorKind%2C%20Result%2C%20TranslationError%2C%20unsupported%7D%3B%0Ause%20super%3A%3Aemit_common%3A%3A%7B%0A%20%20%20%20CtorStyle%2C%20EmitOptions%2C%20EmitState%2C%20Emitted%2C%20mutual_groups%2C%20order_declarations%2C%20unthreaded%2C%0A%7D%3B%0Ause%20super%3A%3Air%3A%3A%7B%0A%20%20%20%20ByZero%2C%20Case%2C%20DataDecl%2C%20Decl%2C%20Effect%2C%20Expr%2C%20FnDecl%2C%20Hints%2C%20LitValue%2C%20Main%2C%20Node%2C%20Param%2C%0A%20%20%20%20Pattern%2C%20Plan%2C%20Program%2C%20Prop%2C%20Semantics%2C%20TheoremDecl%2C%20rename_function%2C%20rename_main%2C%0A%20%20%20%20rename_theorem%2C%0A%7D%3B%0Ause%20super%3A%3Aoutput%3A%3Athread_output_for_target%3B%0Ause%20super%3A%3Aproof%3A%3Aprop_functions%3B%0Ause%20super%3A%3Asurface%3A%3A%7BBinar