(77689: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %2F%2F%21%20The%20Rust%20emitter%3A%20writes%20a%20checked%20program%20as%20Rust%20with%20its%20translation%20contract.%0A%2F%2F%21%0A%2F%2F%21%20Naturals%20and%20integers%20are%20%60ml%3A%3ABig%60%2C%20an%20unbounded%20integer%20the%20translation%0A%2F%2F%21%20carries%20in%20its%20own%20prelude%2C%20so%20no%20value%20is%20ever%20narrowed%3B%20machine%20integers%0A%2F%2F%21%20stay%20Rust%20machine%20integers%20with%20checked%20arithmetic%2C%20which%20panics%20exactly%0A%2F%2F%21%20where%20the%20source%20aborts%3B%20a%20JavaScript%20Number%20is%20an%20%60f64%60%2C%20printed%20by%0A%2F%2F%21%20%60ml_number%3A%3Ajs_number%60%20exactly%20as%20JavaScript%20prints%20it.%20Data%20types%20are%20enums%0A%2F%2F%21%20whose%20data-typed%20fields%20are%20boxed.%20Every%20value%20is%20owned%3A%20a%20variable%20is%20cloned%20where%20it%20is%20consumed.%0A%2F%2F%21%20Theorems%20cannot%20be%20proved%20in%20Rust%3A%20each%20becomes%20an%20executable%20property%2C%0A%2F%2F%21%20checked%20over%20a%20bounded%20domain%20by%20%60--ml-check-theorems%60%2C%20while%20the%20proof%0A%2F%2F%21%20stays%20discharged%20by%20the%20source%20kernel.%0A%2F%2F%21%0A%2F%2F%21%20Mirrors%20%60js%2Fsrc%2Ftranslation%2Femit-rust.js%60.%0A%0Ause%20std%3A%3Acollections%3A%3A%7BBTreeMap%2C%20BTreeSet%7D%3B%0Ause%20std%3A%3Afmt%3A%3AWrite%20as%20_%3B%0A%0Ause%20super%3A%3Adecimal%3A%3ADecimal%3B%0Ause%20super%3A%3Adiagnostics%3A%3A%7BResult%2C%20unsupported%7D%3B%0Ause%20super%3A%3Aemit_common%3A%3A%7BCtorStyle%2C%20EmitOptions%2C%20EmitState%2C%20Emitted%7D%3B%0Ause%20super%3A%3Afrontend_rules%3A%3A%7B%0A%20%20%20%20accept_constant_emission%2C%20constant_binding_form%2C%20render_constant_binding%2C%0A%7D%3B%0Ause%20super%3A%3Air%3A%3A%7B%0A%20%20%20%20Binder%2C%20ByZero%2C%20Decl%2C%20Effect%2C%20Expr%2C%20LitValue%2C%20Node%2C%20Pattern%2C%20Program%2C%20Prop%2C%20Scope%2C%20Semantics%2C%0A%20%20%20%20rename_function%2C%20rename_main%2C%20rename